Author: Fervi (IntinteDAO) <lordfervi@protonmail.com>
Subject: Replace -Weverything with -Wall for Clang
Description: Clang's -Weverything enables all experimental diagnostics,
 which can cause build failures across newer compiler toolchains.
 Replace with -Wall.
Forwarded: not-needed

--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -253,7 +253,7 @@
 if("${CMAKE_CXX_COMPILER_ID}" STREQUAL "Clang")
   set(warn_disable_flags
-    "-Weverything"
+    "-Wall"
 
     # Disabled warnings that are overly verbose right now or just do not make sense.
     "-Wno-c++98-compat"
